{"step_index":877,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T21:14:45Z","input_tokens":106198,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":3445,"thinking":"All six specified folders and corresponding summary files have been successfully synchronized to the network-attached storage. Verified that each folder, including those with varying cycle parameters and filenames containing special characters, completed the transfer.\n\n\nSuccessfully synchronized the remaining data sets and their summaries to the network storage. Confirmed data integrity for all completed tasks across various cycle parameters and filenames, including those with special characters. The scientific report will comprehensively cover the complete execution of calculations, data storage, and the summary's synchronization as per the specified instructions. Further report sections will detail the raw data for each cycle number alongside a critical discussion of the key physics, especially surface energies for even cycles and the geometric constraints in odd cycles.\n\n\nThe observed energy reduction in the slab model is consistent with the expected value per atom. Imposing periodic boundary conditions in the bulk model for odd-layer structures introduces an artificial antiphase boundary, which increases the total energy. This artificial boundary energy caused a discrepancy in the calculated surface energy. The true surface energies can be calculated by applying the bulk energy density.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport os\nimport csv\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use('Agg')\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.font_manager as fm\nfrom matplotlib.offsetbox import AnchoredOffsetbox, HPacker, TextArea\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR = '/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup'\nmincho = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, 'msmincho.ttc')\ntimes = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, 'times.ttf')\ntimesbd = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, 'timesbd.ttf')\n\nfont_label = fm.FontProperties(fname=mincho, size=14.5)\nfont_tick = fm.FontProperties(fname=times, size=11.5)\nfont_lit_jp = fm.FontProperties(fname=mincho, weight='bold', size=12.0)\nfont_lit_en = fm.FontProperties(fname=timesbd, weight='bold', size=12.5)\n\nAREA_2A = 279.497664\nCONV_FACTOR = 16.021766\nEFFECTIVE_DENOM = AREA_2A / CONV_FACTOR\ne_bulk_per_atom = -159657.6701 / 360.0 # -443.493528 eV/atom\n\nslab_energies = {\n    1: -15945.0989,\n    2: -31892.6430,\n    3: -47856.6115,\n    4: -63822.0658,\n    5: -79787.7398,\n    6: -95753.5368,\n    7: -111719.3218,\n    8: -127685.0579,\n    9: -143650.8317,\n    10: -159616.6027\n}\n\nperiods = list(range(1, 11))\ngammas_corrected = []\nfor n in periods:\n    natoms = 36 * n\n    eslab = slab_energies[n]\n    if n == 2:\n        # Use verified 2-period bulk SCF (-31935.3572 eV)\n        ebulk = -31935.3572\n    else:\n        ebulk = natoms * e_bulk_per_atom\n    de = eslab - ebulk\n    g = de / EFFECTIVE_DENOM\n    gammas_corrected.append(g)\n\n# Save corrected CSV\ncsv_out = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, 'surface_energy_vs_periods_corrected_plot_data.csv')\nwith open(csv_out, 'w', newline='', encoding='utf-8-sig') as f:\n    w = csv.writer(f)\n    w.writerow(['Periods', 'Natoms', 'E_slab_eV', 'E_bulk_reference_eV', 'Delta_E_eV', 'Area_2A_A2', 'Gamma_J_m2'])\n    for n, g in zip(periods, gammas_corrected):\n        na = 36 * n\n        eslab = slab_energies[n]\n        ebulk = -31935.3572 if n == 2 else na * e_bulk_per_atom\n        de = eslab - ebulk\n        w.writerow([n, na, eslab, round(ebulk, 4), round(de, 4), AREA_2A, round(g, 4)])\n\n# Plot graph adhering to AGENTS.md §7\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(5.6, 4.4), dpi=300)\nax.scatter(periods, gammas_corrected, marker='^', facecolors='none', edgecolors='#8A2BE2', s=70, linewidths=1.6, zorder=5)\n\nLIT_VAL = 3.03\nax.axhline(LIT_VAL, color='#222222', linestyle='--', linewidth=1.2, zorder=3)\n\narea_jp = TextArea('文献値', textprops=dict(fontproperties=font_lit_jp, color='#111111'))\narea_en = TextArea('(3.03 J/m²)', textprops=dict(fontproperties=font_lit_en, color='#111111'))\npacker = HPacker(children=[area_jp, area_en], align='baseline', pad=0, sep=3)\n\ny_norm = (LIT_VAL - 1.0) / (3.2 - 1.0) + 0.024\nanchored = AnchoredOffsetbox(\n    loc='lower right',\n    child=packer,\n    pad=0.0,\n    frameon=False,\n    bbox_to_anchor=(0.95, y_norm),\n    bbox_transform=ax.transAxes,\n)\nax.add_artist(anchored)\n\nax.set_xlim(0.0, 11.0)\nax.set_ylim(1.0, 3.2)\n\nax.set_xlabel(r'周期数  $\\mathrm{[periods]}$', fontproperties=font_label, labelpad=10)\nax.set_ylabel(r'表面破壊エネルギー  $\\mathrm{[J/m^2]}$', fontproperties=font_label, labelpad=10)\n\nx_ticks = [0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10]\nax.set_xticks(x_ticks)\nax.set_xticklabels([str(x) for x in x_ticks], fontproperties=font_tick)\n\ny_ticks = [1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.2, 2.4, 2.6, 2.8, 3.0, 3.2]\nax.set_yticks(y_ticks)\nax.set_yticklabels([f'{y:.1f}' for y in y_ticks], fontproperties=font_tick)\n\nfor spine in ax.spines.values():\n    spine.set_color('black')\n    spine.set_linewidth(1.1)\n\nax.tick_params(axis='both', which='major', direction='in', length=5.5, width=1.0, top=True, right=True, bottom=True, left=True, pad=6.0)\nfig.patch.set_facecolor('white')\nax.set_facecolor('white')\nplt.subplots_adjust(left=0.17, right=0.95, bottom=0.17, top=0.95)\n\nbase = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, '周期数と表面破壊エネルギーの関係_結晶バルク基準')\nplt.savefig(f'{base}.png', dpi=300)\nplt.savefig(f'{base}.pdf')\nplt.savefig(f'{base}.svg')\nplt.close()\nprint('Generated corrected period graphs successfully!')\n\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Generate true bulk corrected period comparison graphs"}}]}
